<title>GERMANY: Buba sets May minimum reserves at 39.5 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Buba sets May minimum reserves at 39.5 bln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Monday it had set the provisional monthly reserve requirement for commercial banks for May at 39.5 billion marks.</p>
<p>German money market traders said the level was at the lower end of market expectations.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
